{"content_hash": "9eb7d60c815821ec", "version_id": 1065, "article_id": 109, "level_code": "en_c1", "lang": "en", "level": 5, "level_label": "C1 高级", "title": "Cozy gardening sim Green New Life plants itself on Steam this December", "title_zh": "温馨园艺模拟游戏《绿色新生活》将于今年12月登陆Steam", "has_translation": true, "topic": "culture", "source": "gcores", "source_url": "https://www.gcores.com/articles/222792", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1789370902773-b8dcdcf4b4ca?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8Mnx8Y2FsbSUyMGdhbWUlMjBncmVlbnxlbnwwfDB8fHwxNzk1NjY0NTcyfDA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by panpan ma on Unsplash", "author": "panpan ma", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@mymphoebe?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/people-relaxing-in-mengyang-park-O8VETz13QlA?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(180, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(218, 46%, 48%)", "label": "CULTURE", "seed": "dd7cc7a7ba8d"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-26", "word_count": 279, "reading_minutes": 1.4, "lead": "Publisher Gamirror Games has dated Positive Impact Games' restorative gardening sim for a December 7 Steam launch, on the back of a warmly received demo and a growing wishlist following.", "lead_zh": "发行商Gamirror Games已确定Positive Impact Games的治愈系园艺模拟游戏将于12月7日在Steam上线，此前该游戏的试玩版广受好评，愿望单数量也持续增长。", "preview": "Green New Life, the healing cultivation sim from developer Positive Impact Games, will arrive on Steam on December 7, publisher Gamirror Gam", "preview_zh": "发行商Gamirror Games宣布，开发商Positive Impact Games打造的治愈系种植模拟游戏《绿色新生活》将于12月7日登陆Steam。玩家将受邀种植作物、与远古精灵交朋友，而且或许最重要的是——拥抱遇到的每一个可爱的人和生物。游戏以温暖的民间传说为框架，让玩", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 1048, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/109/en_c1.mp3", "duration": 107.675, "size_bytes": 646992, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 313, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/109/en_c1_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 110.8, "size_bytes": 665712, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 313, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/109/en_c1_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/109/en_c1_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 117.0, "size_bytes": 703008, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 313, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/109/en_c1_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/109/en_c1_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 100.4, "size_bytes": 603360, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 313, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/109/en_c1_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/109/en_c1_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 108.475, "size_bytes": 651744, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 313, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/109/en_c1_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@23dfc2cf/content/data/versions/1065.json", "paragraphs": ["Green New Life, the healing cultivation sim from developer Positive Impact Games, will arrive on Steam on December 7, publisher Gamirror Games has announced. Players are invited to plant, befriend ancient spirits and — perhaps most crucially — embrace every endearing person and creature they encounter. Framed as a warm folk tale, the game casts the player as the agent of the world's recovery, restoring habitats and coaxing wasteland back to life.", "The premise is unabashedly gentle: with one's own hands, sincerity and a touch of magic, players repair a broken landscape and watch seeds swell into trees and deserts yield to oases. Progress is made legible through sensory cues — a warm breeze stirring fresh grass, frogs returning to the wetlands, rain finally falling. The result is a sandbox in which players reshape everything and fashion a personal paradise at their own pace.", "Designers have pitched the title squarely at casual players. There are no countdowns and no creeping sense of urgency; the land is healed slowly, on the player's own schedule. Ecological recovery is made visible, so that every action registers as a contribution to nature's revival. An adaptive soundtrack and ASMR-calibre ambient audio fold wind, rain and running water into the journey, while intuitive mechanics are paired with folklore to introduce a distinctive natural world.", "Early signals are encouraging. A demo released in October has drawn a 'Very Positive' rating on Steam, with 89 percent of reviews favourable, and the game has amassed more than 50,000 wishlist additions on the platform. Whether that goodwill converts into sales when the full release lands on December 7 remains to be seen, but the groundwork has plainly been laid."], "paragraphs_zh": ["发行商Gamirror Games宣布，开发商Positive Impact Games打造的治愈系种植模拟游戏《绿色新生活》将于12月7日登陆Steam。玩家将受邀种植作物、与远古精灵交朋友，而且或许最重要的是——拥抱遇到的每一个可爱的人和生物。游戏以温暖的民间传说为框架，让玩家扮演世界复苏的推动者，修复栖息地，让荒地重焕生机。", "游戏的前提毫不掩饰地温柔：凭借自己的双手、真诚和一丝魔法，玩家修复破碎的土地，看着种子长成大树，沙漠变成绿洲。进展通过感官线索变得清晰可见——温暖的微风吹动新草，青蛙重返湿地，雨水终于落下。最终呈现的是一个沙盒世界，玩家可以重塑一切，按自己的节奏打造个人天堂。", "设计者将这款作品明确瞄准休闲玩家。游戏没有倒计时，也没有逐渐逼近的紧迫感；土地按照玩家自己的节奏慢慢愈合。生态恢复变得可见，因此每一个行动都算作对自然复兴的贡献。自适应配乐和ASMR级别环境音效将风声、雨声和流水声融入旅程，直观的机制与民间传说相结合，呈现出一个独特的自然世界。", "早期信号令人鼓舞。10月发布的试玩版在Steam上获得“特别好评”，89%的评价为正面，游戏在该平台上的愿望单添加量已超过5万。当完整版于12月7日发布时，这些好感能否转化为销量还有待观察，但基础显然已经打好。"], "body": "Green New Life, the healing cultivation sim from developer Positive Impact Games, will arrive on Steam on December 7, publisher Gamirror Games has announced. Players are invited to plant, befriend ancient spirits and — perhaps most crucially — embrace every endearing person and creature they encounter. Framed as a warm folk tale, the game casts the player as the agent of the world's recovery, restoring habitats and coaxing wasteland back to life.\n\nThe premise is unabashedly gentle: with one's own hands, sincerity and a touch of magic, players repair a broken landscape and watch seeds swell into trees and deserts yield to oases. Progress is made legible through sensory cues — a warm breeze stirring fresh grass, frogs returning to the wetlands, rain finally falling. The result is a sandbox in which players reshape everything and fashion a personal paradise at their own pace.\n\nDesigners have pitched the title squarely at casual players. There are no countdowns and no creeping sense of urgency; the land is healed slowly, on the player's own schedule. Ecological recovery is made visible, so that every action registers as a contribution to nature's revival. An adaptive soundtrack and ASMR-calibre ambient audio fold wind, rain and running water into the journey, while intuitive mechanics are paired with folklore to introduce a distinctive natural world.\n\nEarly signals are encouraging. A demo released in October has drawn a 'Very Positive' rating on Steam, with 89 percent of reviews favourable, and the game has amassed more than 50,000 wishlist additions on the platform. Whether that goodwill converts into sales when the full release lands on December 7 remains to be seen, but the groundwork has plainly been laid.", "body_zh": "发行商Gamirror Games宣布，开发商Positive Impact Games打造的治愈系种植模拟游戏《绿色新生活》将于12月7日登陆Steam。玩家将受邀种植作物、与远古精灵交朋友，而且或许最重要的是——拥抱遇到的每一个可爱的人和生物。游戏以温暖的民间传说为框架，让玩家扮演世界复苏的推动者，修复栖息地，让荒地重焕生机。\n\n游戏的前提毫不掩饰地温柔：凭借自己的双手、真诚和一丝魔法，玩家修复破碎的土地，看着种子长成大树，沙漠变成绿洲。进展通过感官线索变得清晰可见——温暖的微风吹动新草，青蛙重返湿地，雨水终于落下。最终呈现的是一个沙盒世界，玩家可以重塑一切，按自己的节奏打造个人天堂。\n\n设计者将这款作品明确瞄准休闲玩家。游戏没有倒计时，也没有逐渐逼近的紧迫感；土地按照玩家自己的节奏慢慢愈合。生态恢复变得可见，因此每一个行动都算作对自然复兴的贡献。自适应配乐和ASMR级别环境音效将风声、雨声和流水声融入旅程，直观的机制与民间传说相结合，呈现出一个独特的自然世界。\n\n早期信号令人鼓舞。10月发布的试玩版在Steam上获得“特别好评”，89%的评价为正面，游戏在该平台上的愿望单添加量已超过5万。当完整版于12月7日发布时，这些好感能否转化为销量还有待观察，但基础显然已经打好。", "text": "Green New Life, the healing cultivation sim from developer Positive Impact Games, will arrive on Steam on December 7, publisher Gamirror Games has announced. Players are invited to plant, befriend ancient spirits and — perhaps most crucially — embrace every endearing person and creature they encounter. Framed as a warm folk tale, the game casts the player as the agent of the world's recovery, restoring habitats and coaxing wasteland back to life. The premise is unabashedly gentle: with one's own hands, sincerity and a touch of magic, players repair a broken landscape and watch seeds swell into trees and deserts yield to oases. Progress is made legible through sensory cues — a warm breeze stirring fresh grass, frogs returning to the wetlands, rain finally falling. The result is a sandbox in which players reshape everything and fashion a personal paradise at their own pace. Designers have pitched the title squarely at casual players. There are no countdowns and no creeping sense of urgency; the land is healed slowly, on the player's own schedule. Ecological recovery is made visible, so that every action registers as a contribution to nature's revival. An adaptive soundtrack and ASMR-calibre ambient audio fold wind, rain and running water into the journey, while intuitive mechanics are paired with folklore to introduce a distinctive natural world. Early signals are encouraging. A demo released in October has drawn a 'Very Positive' rating on Steam, with 89 percent of reviews favourable, and the game has amassed more than 50,000 wishlist additions on the platform. Whether that goodwill converts into sales when the full release lands on December 7 remains to be seen, but the groundwork has plainly been laid.", "vocab": [{"word": "cultivation", "pos": "noun", "zh": "种植；培育", "note": "常用于模拟游戏语境，指种植养成", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "unabashedly", "pos": "adv", "zh": "毫不掩饰地", "note": "强调某种特质公开而坦然", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "coax", "pos": "verb", "zh": "哄劝；慢慢使…发生", "note": "coax sth back to life 生动表达“使复苏”", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "wasteland", "pos": "noun", "zh": "荒地", "note": "与 oasis 常形成对比", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "oasis", "pos": "noun", "zh": "绿洲", "note": "复数 oases", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "legible", "pos": "adj", "zh": "清晰可辨的", "note": "此处引申为“变化看得见”", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "sensory", "pos": "adj", "zh": "感官的", "note": "sensory cues 感官提示", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "pitch", "pos": "verb", "zh": "定位；推销", "note": "pitch a title at players 面向某群体定位", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "squarely", "pos": "adv", "zh": "直接地；完全地", "note": "squarely at 强调目标明确", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "creeping", "pos": "adj", "zh": "悄然蔓延的", "note": "creeping sense of urgency 渐生的紧迫感", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "ambient", "pos": "adj", "zh": "环境的；氛围的", "note": "ambient audio 环境音效", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "intuitive", "pos": "adj", "zh": "直观的；易上手的", "note": "常形容操作简单", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "amass", "pos": "verb", "zh": "积累；聚集", "note": "amass wishlists 积累愿望单", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "convert", "pos": "verb", "zh": "转化", "note": "convert into sales 转化为销量", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-11-26T03:42:27.570696", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "Green", "s": 0.275, "e": 0.575, "sm": 275, "em": 574, "cs": 0, "ce": 5, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "New", "s": 0.575, "e": 0.75, "sm": 575, "em": 750, "cs": 6, "ce": 9, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "Life", "s": 0.75, "e": 1.2, "sm": 750, "em": 1200, "cs": 10, "ce": 14, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": ",", "s": 1.2, "e": 1.275, "sm": 1200, "em": 1274, "cs": 14, "ce": 15, "si": 0}, {"i": 4, "w": "the", "s": 1.275, "e": 1.375, "sm": 1275, "em": 1375, "cs": 16, "ce": 19, "si": 0}, {"i": 5, "w": "healing", "s": 1.375, "e": 1.675, "sm": 1375, "em": 1675,